      "description": "Inspection should begin with the request-construction and preparation path around `requests.Request`, because the snapshot identifies a test that prepares a GET request containing long authentication information and verifies that the prepared URL remains unchanged. This is an inspection target for understanding how authentication data is carried into a request, but the snapshot does not identify a dedicated authentication extension point or prove that any particular module must change. [Data: Reports (13)]",
